---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="友情链接 - Astro Blog" description="言西早木的友情链接页面，发现更多有趣的博客和网站。">
	<main>
		<h1>友情 <span class="text-gradient">链接</span></h1>
		<div class="intro">
			<p>
				这里是一些我喜欢的博客和网站，希望能对你有所帮助。
			</p>
			<p>
				如果你也想交换友链，欢迎通过邮件联系我！
			</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="friends-section">
			<h2 class="section-title">
				<svg style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 0.5rem;" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
					<path d="M11 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7"></path>
					<path d="M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z"></path>
				</svg>
				申请友链
			</h2>
			<div class="placeholder-card">
				<p>友链申请中...</p>
				<p class="placeholder-text">期待与更多有趣的博主交流！</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		
		<div class="contact-info">
			<h2 class="section-title">
				<svg style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 0.5rem;" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
					<path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
					<polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
				</svg>
				联系方式
			</h2>
			<p>邮箱：<a href="mailto:tanshujian@linux.do,tanshujian131@qq.com">tanshujian@linux.do</a></p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	main {
		margin: auto;
		padding: 2rem 1rem;
		max-width: 900px;
		user-select: none;
		-webkit-user-select: none;
		-moz-user-select: none;
		-ms-user-select: none;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--c-text);
	}
	h1 span {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
	}
	h1 span::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 2px;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 8px;
		background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
		z-index: -1;
		border-radius: 4px;
	}
	
	.intro {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--c-card-bg);
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-light);
	}
	.intro p {
		margin: 0.5rem 0;
		color: var(--c-text-light);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}
	
	.section-title {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--c-text);
	}
	
	.friends-section {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}
	
	.placeholder-card {
		background: var(--c-card-bg);
		padding: 3rem 2rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-light);
		text-align: center;
		border: 2px dashed rgba(56, 182, 255, 0.3);
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}
	.placeholder-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--c-primary);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
	}
	.placeholder-card p {
		margin: 0.5rem 0;
		color: var(--c-text-light);
	}
	.placeholder-text {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-style: italic;
	}
	
	.contact-info {
		background: var(--c-card-bg);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-light);
	}
	.contact-info p {
		margin: 0.5rem 0;
		color: var(--c-text-light);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}
	.contact-info a {
		color: var(--c-primary);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}
	.contact-info a:hover {
		color: var(--c-secondary);
	}
</style>
